  description: `Alphesiboeus sings as a woman whose Daphnis has gone to the city. With her servant Amaryllis she works a love spell: wool, incense, three threads, a clay and a wax figure, a laurel in the fire. After each stage the refrain begs her charms to bring Daphnis home.`,
